# Keeps the Docker build context small and forces every image to produce
# its own node_modules/dist inside the build (pnpm install + the
# @relis/config build step), instead of accidentally baking in whatever
# happens to exist on the host checkout. See
# docs/architecture/docker-compose-stack.md.

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.git
.vscode
*.log

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
